    <briefdescription>
<para>No-op secrets implementation for testing or when a secrets backend is not configured. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Always reports &quot;not found&quot; for every secret name. Use this in unit tests or in environments where credentials are supplied through other means (e.g. mounted Kubernetes secrets read directly by the application). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
